eps.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x160","subtitle":"The ring motif doubles as program progress: completed rings turn olive, upcoming stay grey.","name":"Step indicator"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-tagline.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"Rings cropped behind centred type, held legible by the cream aperture gradient.","name":"Tagline lockup"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-voice.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x176","subtitle":"Plain-spoken, first-person plural, no jargon and no emoji. Renewal words: unlearn, renewal, rebuild.","name":"Voice in one card"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-wordmark.card.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"No logo file exists. The name is set in Newsreader small caps at 0.24em - Латиница on EN pages, Морана on BG.","name":"Wordmark"},{"path":"guidelines/color-cream.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"The brand ground: page, cards, and inverse type. --cream-400 is the source palette hue.","name":"Cream ground"},{"path":"guidelines/color-ink.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Body copy, headlines, and the dark deck surfaces. --ink-700 is the inverse ground.","name":"Ink - text and inverse"},{"path":"guidelines/color-olive.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Buttons, links, eyebrows, completed steps. --olive-600 is the default accent.","name":"Olive - primary accent"},{"path":"guidelines/color-plum.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Italic accent words, hover on primary buttons, the outer ring.","name":"Plum - reflective"},{"path":"guidelines/color-sage.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Innermost ring, positive states, quiet data. Never used for body text.","name":"Sage - growth"},{"path":"guidelines/color-states.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x132","subtitle":"Derived to stay in the warm family. Used sparingly - forms and nothing else.","name":"States"},{"path":"guidelines/color-surfaces.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Four grounds only. Never stack more than two on one screen.","name":"Semantic surfaces"},{"path":"guidelines/color-text.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Body is never pure black; the accent green is reserved for labels and links.","name":"Text roles"},{"path":"components/content/content.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x330","subtitle":"Program cards for both tracks, deferred state, research callout","name":"Content"},{"path":"components/core/core.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x340","subtitle":"Button variants and states, badges, ring marks, section heading","name":"Core"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x400","subtitle":"Input states, multiline, and the full contact form","name":"Forms"},{"path":"components/navigation/navigation.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"Header in both languages, language toggle, inverse footer","name":"Navigation"},{"path":"guidelines/motion-easing.card.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Entrances run once on --ease-brand; the ring field loops forever. Hover 200ms, press 160ms at 0.97.","name":"Easing and duration"},{"path":"guidelines/motion-rings.card.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x190","subtitle":"Four orbits at 16/26/40/58s in alternating directions, with a ring expanding through them every 7s. Always cropped.","name":"The ring field"},{"path":"guidelines/shape-elevation.card.html","group":"Shape","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Depth comes from hairlines and cream tint shifts. Shadows are near-invisible by design.","name":"Borders and elevation"},{"path":"guidelines/shape-radius.card.html","group":"Shape","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Square-cornered brand: 2px on rectangles, circles for the motif, pills only for the language toggle.","name":"Radii"},{"path":"guidel